VPC
STEP-1 : create VPC 
         name tag:"MyVPC" 
         IPV4 CIDR Block :10.0.0.0/16 
         leave others default -----create
STEP-2 : Create subnets
         you need to create 2 subnets
         PUBLIC SUBNET
         name : PublicSubnet
         VPC ID : MyVPC
         CIDR block : 10.0.1.0/24
         Availability Zone : select 1a  --------create subnet
         PRIVATE SUBNET
         name : PrivateSubnet
         VPC ID : MyVPC
         CIDR block : 10.0.2.0/24
         Availability Zone : select 1b -----------create subnet
STEP-3 : Create and Attach Internet Gateway(IGW)
         Name : MyIGW -------- create internet gate way
         Attach to VPC : MyVPC
